# CMU14 ECS-702 / ECS-711 / ECS-712 (D17): the front-line Medic

cmu-bad-blood-medic-not-clan = Only a living clanmate or clan beast can be treated this way.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-no-immobilizer = A medic carries no immobilizer.

# Field Mend
cmu-bad-blood-medic-mend-start = You start patching { $target }.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-mend-cooldown = { $target } was patched too recently. Wait { $seconds } seconds.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-mend-done = You patch { $target } up.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-mend-patient = { $medic } patches you up: the bleeding stops and the pain dulls.

# Blood Rite
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-start = { $medic } begins a blood rite over { $target }!
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-not-critical = { $target } is not near death. The rite is for the dying.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-dead = { $target } is beyond any rite.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-sick = { $target } cannot take another rite yet. Wait { $seconds } seconds.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-done = The rite takes hold. { $target } rises.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-rite-patient = The rite drags you back to your feet. Get clear: you cannot fight until your second wind fades, and no rite will hold you again for { $minutes } minutes.
cmu-bad-blood-medic-second-wind-end = Your second wind fades. You can fight again.

# the Lodge cauldron
cmu-bad-blood-medic-cauldron-tonic = You render the limb down into { $count } tonic crystals.

# the regeneration tonic
cmu-bad-blood-tonic-regrowth-guidebook = Lost limbs regrow in { $multiplier } of the usual time while it lasts
reagent-name-cmu-bad-blood-tonic = blood-moss tonic
reagent-desc-cmu-bad-blood-tonic = A bitter green brew of the Bad Blood clans. It heals a fighter slowly, knits bone and hurries a lost limb back, but does nothing for the dying.
